# Makefile.npm of databases/mongosh: the npm modules of mongosh 2.14.3 from
# registry.npmjs.org, MONGOSH_NPM=<its directory under the tree of the package, . for
# mongosh>:<name>:<version>. The tree npm installs for mongosh 2.14.3 (its
# npm-shrinkwrap.json) without the modules for development and the optional ones (the
# native modules: the machine id of the telemetry, the version of the crypt library of
# the client-side field level encryption, the certificates of Windows and macOS, the
# kerberos, mongodb-client-encryption and os-dns-native of the driver, and those they
# need), but in js-beautify and editorconfig (the formatting of the edit command) glob
# 14.0.6 and minimatch 11.0.9 in the place of 13.0.7 and 10.2.6 (GHSA-3g3m-2fjr-6pw4,
# GHSA-g3hv-75wg-m249), with path-scurry 3.0.0 (glob 14) and
# @isaacs/nonrecursive-glob-match 1.1.0 (minimatch 11): none of the modules in the
# advisory database of npm (19.11.2026).

